  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell functions as mental barrier III, but if you are struck by a critical hit or sneak attack, there is a 25% chance that the additional damage is negated (as light fortification). This does not stack with similar effects that negate the additional damage from a critical hit or sneak attack. In addition, you are immune to mind thrust I and II, and you take half damage from mind thrust III, IV, and V (reduced to one-quarter on a successful Will save). This spell can be undercast.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell functions as mental barrier iii, but if you are struck by a critical hit or sneak attack, there is a 25% chance that the additional damage is negated (as light fortification). this does not stack with similar effects that negate the additional damage from a critical hit or sneak attack. in addition, you are immune to mind thrust i and ii, and you take half damage from mind thrust iii, iv, and v (reduced to one-quarter on a successful will save). this spell can be undercast.\"",
